OL,3,AWhatsApp introduces optional parental
OL,4,Acontrols for teenagers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhatsApp is introducing new parental
OL,7,Fcontrols for teenagers, as tech
OL,8,Fcompanies continue to come under
OL,9,Fpressure to provide more
OL,10,Fage-appropriate experiences for
OL,11,Fchildren.
OL,13,FThe social messaging app's new tools
OL,14,Fwill give parents a range of options,
OL,15,Fsuch as being told when their child
OL,16,Fjoins or leaves a group. It will also
OL,17,Flet them decide on privacy settings for
OL,18,Ftheir account.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
